docs {
  # POST /admin/graph/materialize

  Starts the **offline** `AnalyticsMaterializeWorkflow` on the
  `kb-graph-build` queue: GDS centrality (weighted pagerank /
  betweenness / eigenvector) + link-prediction + risk scores,
  written back onto `__Entity__` nodes in Neo4j.

  **Prerequisite for the `/api/v1/analyze` primitives**
  `top_central_entities`, `link_prediction`, `risk_score` — without a
  run they read stale (or missing) values. Run after every bulk
  ingest and after `reresolve_graph`.

  ## Behaviour
  Fire-and-forget: returns 202 with the workflow id immediately;
  progress is visible in Temporal UI (`analytics-materialize-*`).
  Concurrency knob: `TEMPORAL_ANALYTICS_MATERIALIZE_CONCURRENCY`.

  ## Response 202
  ```json
  { "workflow_id": "analytics-materialize-<hex>", "status": "started" }
  ```

  See `docs/runbook/graph-analytics.md`.
}
